      "readOnly": true,
      "default": false,
      "description": "Read how the Twitch alerts of the overlay are written. For each type (follow, sub, resub, gift, cheer, raid, online, offline, hype, redeem) whether it is on, its text template (null = the default sentence), its duration in seconds (null = the module default) and its minimum (bits, gifted subs, viewers or points; null = none), its sound and animation, whether a picture is set, the words a template may use (name, count, amount, tier, months, viewers, level, title, text, total, each written between braces in a text), and the state of the queue (paused, held alerts).",
