      "default": false,
      "description": "Change one type of Twitch alert. You can switch it on or off (enabled), set its text (text: plain words with the words between braces listed by alert_templates_get; an empty text restores the default sentence), its duration (durationSeconds 2 to 60, 0 = default) its minimum (minimum: bits, gifted subs, viewers or points, 0 = none; only for cheer, gift, raid, redeem), its sound (sound: none, chime, bell, pop, fanfare; heard only if sounds are switched on) or how it enters (animation: default, slide, slideLeft, slideRight, slideTop, slideBottom, fade, jiggle, pop, none). Unknown words in a text are refused with an explanation. Nothing is deleted and nothing is sent to the screen.",
